{"type": "FeatureCollection", "features": [{"type": "Feature", "properties": {"name": "The island of Newfoundland (not Labrador)", "source": "Owner, Oct 11: no Chabad activity found in the far north of the provinces (searched Chabad sites, news and roving-rabbi reports), so north of a line just past the furthest activity is land in no shetach, like the Yukon and NWT north of 63\u00b0N. Only the province's own land is cut by it. Newfoundland and Labrador: Chabad of Newfoundland in St. John's, its Friendship Circle mailing across the province; nothing found in Labrador (Goose Bay, Labrador City, Nain). Every piece of GADM's Newfoundland and Labrador that isn't Labrador or an island off it (the island with the Port au Port peninsula and its own small islands), carried 8 km out."}, "geometry": {"type": "MultiPolygon", "coordinates": [[[[-56.97005, 47.46428], [-56.93739, 47.45341], [-56.91364, 47.43355], [-56.89921, 47.40616], [-56.89626, 47.37534], [-56.90523, 47.34571], [-56.92478, 47.3217], [-56.95787, 47.30317], [-56.98957, 47.30017], [-57.01992, 47.30977], [-57.04657, 47.33175], [-57.0608, 47.3601], [-57.0629, 47.39176], [-57.05252, 47.42174], [-57.02751, 47.44885], [-57.00027, 47.4621], [-56.97005, 47.46428]]], [[[-57.39197, 47.42255], [-57.41588, 47.42422], [-57.43535, 47.43014], [-57.45509, 47.44256], [-57.47336, 47.46174], [-57.48389, 47.47875], [-57.49168, 47.5014], [-57.4924, 47.52535], [-57.48689, 47.54617], [-57.52743, 47.54735], [-57.54608, 47.52871], [-57.57529, 47.51302], [-57.59723, 47.50688], [-57.61243, 47.50635], [-57.63309, 47.51015], [-57.65496, 47.51913], [-57.68447, 47.52041], [-57.70005, 47.52438], [-57.72116, 47.53595], [-57.73666, 47.55172], [-57.77301, 47.54031], [-57.79604, 47.54025], [-57.86663, 47.56546], [-57.89229, 47.56503], [-57.9308, 47.57307], [-57.95084, 47.58124], [-58.00409, 47.58409], [-58.0564, 47.59656], [-58.09589, 47.59279], [-58.12681, 47.60281], [-58.16039, 47.60027], [-58.1866, 47.58178], [-58.20926, 47.57537], [-58.23282, 